  "id": "ego-resiliency",
  "term": "ego resiliency",
  "definition": "Ego resiliency is a personality trait describing a person’s ability to adjust flexibly and effectively to internal and external stressors as circumstances change. It is closely tied to self-regulation and supports healthy functioning even under difficult conditions.",
